                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>In the course of his visit to Washington, March 14–18, 1953, Belgian Foreign
                    Minister Van Zeeland raised the issue of command structure and jurisdiction
                    within the central sector of NATO. For a record of his discussion of these
                    topics, see the memorandum of conversation by Assistant Secretary of State
                    Merchant, March 16, <ref target="#pg773">page 773</ref>.</p>
            </div>
